HOL Light and HOL4
==================

Notices: LICENSES/HOL-Light.txt and LICENSES/HOL4.txt

The formalization corresponds to the HOL Light-style Rhombus/HOL kernel and
the HOL4-style base logic. It is conservatively treated as second-generation
derivative material under those upstream notices in addition to 0BSD.

Isabelle/HOL and HOL-ZF
======================

Upstream: https://isabelle.in.tum.de/
Notice: LICENSES/Isabelle.txt

The Rhombus_HOL_Kernel theories are original material under 0BSD and import the
Isabelle HOL-ZF session. The import is a dependency, not a relicensing of these
theory sources. An HTML presentation produced by `isabelle build -P` may also
reproduce Isabelle/HOL or HOL-ZF source and presentation assets; distributions
of that generated presentation must include the Isabelle notice.
